<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.canon.promotes ~ the priesthood act, performed as a residency move and recorded

`lares meme promote <…/x.mem>` crosses one carrier into a canon bag: a residency move that changes the envelope's bag and nothing else (no rename, no host, no re-stamp), signed by the selected face (`--face N`, named wherever several faces stand) and recorded as a durable receipt. The cap reading rides a rehearsal that moves nothing first. `--from-bag` and `--dest-bag` name the bags; a crossing into `lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/crossroads` also needs the seats' approval of these exact bytes (`--approval <approval.json>`, checked against `--nexus <aid>` where named).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ promote · crossroads

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`promote` params=`file/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/x.mem face/0 ~ the selected face signs the canon crossing`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`crossroads` params=`file/x.mem dest-bag/lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/crossroads approval/a.json ~ publish for the Nexus: the seats approved these bytes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file · face · from-bag · dest-bag · approval · nexus

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<…/x.mem> ~ the carrier to cross`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the signing face, by persona index; named where several stand`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from-bag` params=`takes/bag ~ the bag it leaves`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`dest-bag` params=`takes/bag ~ the canon bag it crosses into; the cap reads against this name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`approval` params=`takes/host-path ~ the seats' approval of these bytes, as JSON`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus whose seats the approval reads against`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ocap/admin-on-the-destination key/face ~ the destination bag's admin cap, read by rehearsal, then the face signs the crossing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · verb-error · cap-denied

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.canon.promotes file/x.mem face/0]] ~ no carrier named, a malformed --face, or several faces and none named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ the approval reads malformed, or the crossing refused; the reason rides the message`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cap-denied` params=`~ the face holds no admin cap on the destination bag`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ promoted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`promoted` params=`exit/0 ~ the carrier crossed and the receipt landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares meme promote

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares meme promote]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

